 Click the button below to agree to our <a href=\"/about/terms_of_use.php\">terms of use</a>.\n</p>\n<button type=\"button\" id=\"acceptTerms\">Accept Terms</button>\n</div>\n<div id=\"postForm\">\n<form method=\"post\" action=\"https://api.marine-geo.org/services/download/download_accept.php\" name=\"data_link\" id=\"data_link\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <hr class=\"gradient\"/>\n    <span class=\"setstitle\">What is the intended use for this data?</span>\n    <hr class=\"gradient\" style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"/>\n    <div id=\"purpose_block\">\n        <div class=\"clearfix\"><label>\n            <input type=\"radio\" class=\"purpose\" name=\"purpose\" value=\"Educational\" />\n            <div>Educational</div>\n        </label></div>\n        <div class=\"clearfix\"><label>\n            <input type=\"radio\" class=\"purpose\" name=\"purpose\" value=\"Research\" />\n            <div>Research</div>\n        </label></div>\n        <div class=\"clearfix\"><label>\n            <input type=\"radio\" class=\"purpose\" name=\"purpose\" value=\"Personal\" />\n            <div>Personal Interest</div>\n        </label></div>\n                    <div class=\"clearfix\"><label>\n                <input type=\"radio\" class=\"purpose\" name=\"purpose\" value=\"Business\" />\n                <div>Commercial</div>\n            </label></div>\n                <div class=\"clearfix\"><label>\n            <input type=\"radio\" class=\"purpose\" name=\"purpose\" value=\"Other\" />\n            <div>Other&nbsp;<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"otherText\" id=\"otherText\" disabled size=\"40\" placeholder=\"Please describe\" /></div>\n        </label></div>\n    </div>\n        <div id=\"downloaddiv\">\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"download_submit\" disabled=\"disabled\">Download</button>\n    <div style=\"font-size:.8em;font-weight:100;color:gray;font-style:italic;\">Archive Download is 138.8kB (344.1kB uncompressed)</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"client\" name=\"client\" value=\"DataLink\" />\n\t<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"force_download\" name=\"force_download\" value=\"1\" />\n    \n    <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"data_uids\" name=\"data_uids\" value=\"2504732\" />\n\t<div style=\"font-size:.8em;font-weight:100;color:red;text-align:center\">\n\t\tData not intended for navigation\n\t</div>\n</form>\n</div>"
